+//! 3. **Boundedness**: $0.0 \le \text{Overlap}(A, B) \le 100.0$ for all valid weight distributions.
+//! 4. **Deterministic Ordering**: Common stocks are sorted by $\max(w_A(c), w_B(c))$ descending,
